## Document to Simplify

```markdown
---
title: "Federated Learning System"
category: "AI/ML Infrastructure"
difficulty: "Hard"
tags: ["federated-learning", "privacy", "secure-aggregation", "differential-privacy", "ml-platform", "edge-compute", "multi-tenancy"]
